WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.787
Every hour, millions of buildings consume energy.

00:00:03.787 --> 00:00:06.713
Lights, cooling, machines that run all night.

00:00:06.713 --> 00:00:09.965
And much of it is wasted, without anyone noticing.

00:00:11.465 --> 00:00:14.590
A monthly bill tells you how much a building used.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.589
It never tells you how much it should have used.

00:00:17.589 --> 00:00:20.464
Without that benchmark, waste stays invisible,

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:22.089
and savings stay unproven.

00:00:23.589 --> 00:00:27.320
This is Baseline AI, developed by COMPILIX INNOVATIONS.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:30.848
It learns how each building behaves, from its meter,

00:00:30.848 --> 00:00:34.782
the weather and the calendar, and predicts its energy use,

00:00:34.782 --> 00:00:35.664
hour by hour.

00:00:37.164 --> 00:00:40.471
Tested on five hundred and ninety-one real buildings,

00:00:40.471 --> 00:00:43.153
and more than nine million hourly readings,

00:00:43.153 --> 00:00:47.895
it cuts forecast error by forty percent compared with the standard baseline.

00:00:49.395 --> 00:00:52.177
When a building uses more than it should,

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:53.942
Baseline AI raises a flag.

00:00:53.942 --> 00:00:58.013
Equipment left running, a broken schedule, a failing system.

00:00:58.013 --> 00:01:01.406
Teams can act in days, not at the end of the year.

00:01:02.905 --> 00:01:06.500
After an efficiency upgrade, it measures the real savings,

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.049
adjusted for the weather.

00:01:08.049 --> 00:01:11.396
So investors and programmes know what actually worked.

00:01:12.896 --> 00:01:14.473
No sensors to install.

00:01:14.473 --> 00:01:17.340
No engineering model for every building.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:19.992
One model covers an entire portfolio,

00:01:19.992 --> 00:01:22.859
from a single campus to a whole country.

00:01:24.359 --> 00:01:28.551
For building owners, utilities, investors and governments,

00:01:28.551 --> 00:01:31.731
Baseline AI turns meter data into decisions,

00:01:31.731 --> 00:01:34.044
and decisions into energy saved.

00:01:35.544 --> 00:01:36.346
Baseline AI.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:39.021
Know what every building should consume.

00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:42.499
Open source, and ready to pilot with your portfolio.
